Package: geno2ped
Title: Rapid Pedigree Construction from SNP Genotypes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Issabelle", "Ampofo", , "ampofoissabel-quangen@github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: Tools for inferring pedigrees and familial relationships from 
    SNP genotype data. Supports PLINK (bed/bim/fam) and VCF/VCF.GZ input 
    formats. Computes genomic similarity matrices and reconstructs 
    parent-offspring and sibling relationships from population-scale 
    genotype data.
